# StayScout environment configuration
# Copy this file to ".env" and fill in your key. The .env file is gitignored.

# Google Maps API key.
# Used server-side for travel-time (Distance Matrix) calculations and
# served to the app only for address autocomplete (Maps JavaScript API).
# Enable these APIs in Google Cloud: Maps JavaScript API, Places API, Distance Matrix API.
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=

# Optional: change the port the server listens on (defaults to 5173).
# PORT=5173
